<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Stars</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">‍ Nagi</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Stars</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1uwD17vOFKHinqUbOGaOP8</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">4 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Najia Menu Theme Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Intro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(Najia) Hush, hush now, and follow my lead</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(Najia) Don't make a noise, gotta be discreet</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(Najia) Softly now, like a desert breeze</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(Najia) Let me guide you through this maze with ease</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You're playin' my game now, welcome to the maze</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Puzzle queen gigglin' while you're stuck in place</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Serpent surprise</p><p ttm:agent="v1">, say hello to my crew</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Run the math, you're done, now they're comin' for you (Hey)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sneakin' through the pyramid, my time to shine</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Map this whole place out, yeah, it's all in my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You're rushin' like a fool, looks cute, but let me guess</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Wrong step, click-click, now you're part of the mess</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Hey)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(Najia) Hush, hush now, and follow my lead</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Najia) Don't make a noise, gotta be discreet (Hey)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(Najia) Softly now, like a desert breeze</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(Najia) Let me guide you through this maze with ease</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Mind sharp as a blade, every trap memorized</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I learn when I'm hit, so don't be surprised</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You call it chaos, I call it math cause</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I run the numbers, and I planned the path</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't yell, I don't chase (Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I just smile and change the pace (Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You think luck got you through (Haha; oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Nah, my plan carried you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You move loud, I move smart</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You guessed wrong, I take part</p><p ttm:agent="v1">This maze ain't luck or fate divine</p><p ttm:agent="v1">It's a test of skill, and mine is my mind (You got them)[Bridge]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Floor made of riddles, built stone by stone</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Queen of the quiet, this kingdom's my own</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Snakes at my side, yes, they move how I say</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Try not to slip, or they'll come your way (Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Najia) Hush, hush now, and follow my lead (Oh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(Najia) Don't make a noise, gotta be discreet</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(Najia) Softly now, like a desert breeze</p><p ttm:agent="v1">(Najia) Let me guide you through this maze with ease</p></div></body></tt>